+breadcrumb step, and a screen's continuation each answer to a name no other reachable control on
+that screen shares. Where a screen offers one label more than once, every copy a named section
+carries announces that section, and the copy no section carries keeps the bare label: home's hero
+announces `Get started, Introduction` and its invite `Get started, Join the community`; an empty
+channel's recovery on the media kits announces `Contact, Banner ads` while the screen's continuation
+stays `Contact`; an empty issue's recovery announces `Publications, Magazine issue`. Every announced
+name opens with the label the control renders, so the visible label is part of the accessible name
+(WCAG 2.2 SC 2.5.3 Label in Name).
